  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Islamophobia as a Form of Radicalisation (2023), published by Leuven University Press, has no recorded citations yet, but it has been downloaded 2,035 times.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Islamophobia as a Form of Radicalisation by Leen d’Haenens and Abdelwahed Mekki-Berrada was published by Leuven University Press in 2023. It is part of the Islamophobia as a Form of Radicalisation Perspectives on Media, Academia and Socio-political Scapes from Europe and Canada series. Conceptually, the work connects to Right wing, Islamophobia, Portuguese, Political science and Media studies.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">OpenAlex records no citations for the book so far.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">It has been downloaded 2,035 times via OAPEN. The work was funded by KU Leuven.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\" data-wiki-books=\"verified\">The latest English Wikipedia check verified 1 article–work reference matches. These are references or bibliography entries, which may include other editions of the same work; they do not measure readership.</p>\n",
